+/* deck-rx: the zero-IF IQ correction off, for broadcast FM. Its estimates
+ * wander from block to block, and on a wide FM signal that wandering is
+ * heard: about 10 dB more noise in the quiet band between programme and
+ * pilot at 912 kHz than at 456 kHz (low IF), back to within 2 dB with the
+ * correction skipped (measured 2026-10-25, iPad Pro, HF+ R5.0.1). */
